    "result_text": "All tests pass and the full build is green. Here's a summary of what I implemented.\n\n## Change: optional, region-validated `postcode` on owners\n\nThe spec: an owner may include a 4-digit `postcode`; when present it must be valid for the city's region (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099), a city with no known region accepts any 4-digit code, out-of-range or malformed \u2192 400, and it's stored/returned when given \u2014 absent is still accepted (backward-compatible).\n\n**Contract & persistence**\n- `src/main/resources/openapi.yml` \u2014 added an optional `postcode` property (pattern `^[0-9]{4}$`) to the `OwnerFields` schema, so the generated `OwnerFieldsDto`/`OwnerDto` carry it.\n- `model/Owner.java` \u2014 added `postcode` column + getter/setter; MapStruct now auto-maps it in both directions.\n- `db/{hsqldb,h2,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql` \u2014 added the `postcode` column (hsqldb runs the tests under `ddl-auto=none`, so this was required, not just cosmetic).\n\n**Validation (OfficeFloor function injection, per AGENTS.md)**\n- New `rest/function/owner/ValidatePostcode.java` \u2014 a validation-gate step: null \u2192 pass (optional); not 4 digits \u2192 reject; look up the city's region and range, unknown region \u2192 pass, out of range \u2192 reject. Rejects via a new checked `InvalidPostcodeException`.\n- New `rest/escalation/InvalidPostcodeException.java` + `InvalidPostcodeHandler.java` (responds 400) + escalation YAML `officefloor/escalation/...InvalidPostcodeException.yml`.\n- Wired `validatePostcode` into both `owners.POST.yml` (after `validate`) and `owners/{ownerId}.PUT.yml`, and updated `ApplyOwner` to persist `postcode` on update.\n\n**One bug caught in testing:** `Map.of(...).get(null)` throws NPE (immutable maps reject null keys), which 500'd for cities with no region. Fixed by null-guarding the region lookup before indexing the range table.\n\nTest results: `AcceptanceTest` \u2014 3/3 pass (`coreStoresValidPostcode`, `coreAcceptsOwnerWithoutPostcode`, `errorRejectsMalformedPostcode`); full `mvn test` \u2192 BUILD SUCCESS.",
